AssetStudio -- https://github.com/Razviar/assetstudio (MIT)
  Copyright (c) Perfare, RazTools, Razviar
  Source of truth for the WAV it writes (AudioClipConverter.cs: the header,
  the first subsound only) and the oracle of the WAV test goldens.

Fmod5Sharp -- https://github.com/SamboyCoding/Fmod5Sharp (MIT)
  Copyright (c) 2021 Sam Byass
  The FSB5 container parser (FsbLoader.cs, FmodTypes/, ChunkData/), the
